content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "Person who explores products and buys mobile devices"
    },
    {
      "name": "Catalogue",
      "description": "Collection of mobile device models offered to customers",
      "attributes": [
        "Mobile Device Model"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Mobile Device Model",
      "description": "Specific model type listed in the catalog",
      "attributes": [
        "Description"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Description",
      "description": "Text explaining features or usage of a mobile device model"
    },
    {
      "name": "Mobile Device",
      "description": "Physical mobile device purchased or delivered",
      "attributes": [
        "Mobile Device Model"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Review",
      "description": "Customer feedback about a purchased mobile device",
      "attributes": [
        "Mobile Device"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sales Associate",
      "description": "Employee helping customers choose and buy mobile devices"
    },
    {
      "name": "Purchase",
      "description": "Record of a customer buying a mobile device"
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery",
      "description": "Process of sending a purchased mobile device to a customer"
    },
    {
      "name": "Product Specialist",
      "description": "Expert evaluating models and refining catalog content"
    },
    {
      "name": "Inventory Manager",
      "description": "Employee overseeing stock and warehouse data"
    },
    {
      "name": "Stock Levels",
      "description": "Information showing how many mobile devices are available",
      "attributes": [
        "Mobile Device"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Reorder",
      "description": "Action of requesting new stock for low-quantity mobile devices"
    },
    {
      "name": "Shipment",
      "description": "Incoming delivery of mobile devices or accessories to the warehouse"
    },
    {
      "name": "Warehouse System",
      "description": "System tracking product availability and stock data",
      "attributes": [
        "Stock Levels"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Cataloguing": {
      "objects": [
        "Product Specialist",
        "Catalogue",
        "Mobile Device Model",
        "Description"
      ]
    },
    "Inventory Keeping": {
      "objects": [
        "Inventory Manager",
        "Warehouse System",
        "Stock Levels",
        "Mobile Device",
        "Reorder",
        "Shipment"
      ]
    },
    "Sale": {
      "objects": [
        "Customer",
        "Sales Associate",
        "Mobile Device",
        "Purchase",
        "Delivery",
        "Review"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- In case an object appears in multiple bounded contexts, suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Cataloguing": {
      "derived from": "Cataloguing Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Product Specialist",
        "Catalogue",
        "Mobile Device Model",
        "Description"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Inventory Keeping": {
      "derived from": "Inventory Keeping Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Inventory Manager",
        "Warehouse System",
        "Stock Levels",
        "Mobile Device Record",
        "Reorder",
        "Shipment"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Mobile Device -> Mobile Device Record"
      ]
    },
    "Sale": {
      "derived from": "Sale Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Customer",
        "Sales Associate",
        "Purchased Mobile Device",
        "Purchase",
        "Delivery",
        "Review"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Mobile Device -> Purchased Mobile Device"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
